{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Fix engine changed → safety properties",
  "description": "Runs the fix-engine example and property tests when patch logic changes (specs 03-safe-fix-engine, FIX-*).",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "src/lib/review/**/*.ts",
      "src/providers/ReviewProvider.tsx"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Patch logic changed. Run `npm run test:fix-engine`. The property tests must keep holding for every generated file: a fix changes only its own lines, undo restores the exact content, a fix aimed at missing code is rejected and never lands on an identical line, a resolved finding is not re-reported, re-scan keeps dismissals. A failure here is a safety bug: fix the code and add a regression test named after the bug. Never relax a property. Report the command output in one line."
  }
}
